A1: SRC := /opt/data/workspace/hermes-context/, DST := /workspace/hermes-context/
A2: ∀ sync -> one-way SRC->DST, no writeback
A3: schedule := systemctl --user timer 6h; script standalone when systemd absent
A4: rsync-optional; fallback cp -a/tar pipe; sync CONTENTS src/ -> dst, no nesting
A5_mirror: ∀ path -> DST end state == SRC end state, recursive
A6_dryrun_purity: --dry-run -> zero writes ∀ target incl. logs; DST stays nonexistent (Q16)
A7: fallback reconcile recursive, stale subtrees deleted ∀ depth
A8_placement: log & entrypoints outside mirrored tree (log ~/.cache, entrypoints ~/.local/bin | /workspace/hdcs/bin)
A9_verify_class: equivalence := contents+structure+symlinks; metadata/timestamps/hardlinks ∉ scope
A10: severity bar — FAIL ∀ normal-operation defects; adversarial -> KNOWN_LIMITATIONS (+open)
A11: SRC==DST rejected; source survival outranks freshness; stage+verify precede ∀ DST destruction
A12: guards := realpath identity/ancestor/symlink-into-SRC, both paths, pre-destruction
A13: verified := content-compared staging copy (A9 class); order stage->verify->touch DST; self-verify exit≠0 on staging failure
A14: env-interaction guard := protected-path on script-owned concrete paths; adversarial residue -> KNOWN_LIMITATIONS
A15: guard breadth := concrete instantiated paths, component-boundary comparison, ¬string-prefix
A17: HERMES_CONTEXT_SRC/DST env override = mandated gate contract; deployed paths production values only
open: []
